# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values for your machine.
# `.env` is git-ignored; never commit real secrets.
#
# See docs/05-database-design.md §2.1 for how Prisma 7 reads DATABASE_URL,
# and docs/07-architecture.md §9 for what each of these is for.

# ── Server ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4000, not 3000 — Next.js's `next dev` also defaults to 3000. Pinning the
# API to a different port here removes the collision entirely; see the
# root README's "Getting started" for the full explanation.
PORT=4000

# The frontend's origin — used for CORS (src/main.ts) so the browser can
# call this API cross-origin in development.
WEB_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ── Database (Prisma 7 driver adapter — prisma.config.ts reads this) ──────
# Matches docker-compose.yml's Postgres service.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://nahda:nahda_dev_password@localhost:5432/nahda?schema=public"

# ── Redis (BullMQ background jobs — see src/jobs/) ─────────────────────────
# Matches docker-compose.yml's Redis service.
REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379"

# ── Auth (required — src/modules/auth/jwt.config.ts fails fast if unset) ──
# Generate distinct random secrets, e.g.: openssl rand -hex 32
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET="replace-with-a-random-64-char-hex-string"
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET="replace-with-a-different-random-64-char-hex-string"
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRY=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY=7d

# ── SSLCommerz payment gateway (src/modules/gateway/) ──────────────────────
# The values below are SSLCommerz's PUBLIC sandbox test credentials — fine
# for local dev, but real payment initiation will fail against them (see
# docs/11-hardening.md H-01). Replace with real sandbox/merchant credentials
# to actually test a payment round-trip.
SSLCOMMERZ_STORE_ID="testbox"
SSLCOMMERZ_STORE_PASSWORD="qwerty1234"
SSLCOMMERZ_IS_SANDBOX=true

# Used to build the gateway's redirect URLs (APP_URL) and IPN webhook URL
# (API_URL) — bare origins, no path or trailing slash. Must match wherever
# `web`/`api` actually run for the gateway round-trip to work at all.
APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"
API_URL="http://localhost:4000"

# ── Email (Resend — src/modules/mail/) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Leave RESEND_API_KEY empty in local/dev to use ConsoleMailProvider (logs
# only). Password-reset and future notifications enqueue via BullMQ
# (email-dispatch); the worker process must be running to actually send.
# RESEND_API_KEY=""
# MAIL_FROM="An Nahda Academy <onboarding@resend.dev>"

# ── Seed script (api/prisma/seed.ts) — optional, has built-in defaults ────
# SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL="admin@nahda.local"
# SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD="ChangeMe123!"
